@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Representative end-to-end verification
actor "Owner / browser" as Owner
participant "Web UI and API" as API
participant "Real Git client" as Client
participant "Git Smart HTTP" as HTTP
database "Test metadata and bare repository" as State
Owner -> API : Register and create test repository
API -> State : Persist identity, metadata and storage
Owner -> API : Issue disposable PAT
Owner -> Client : Commit and push test content
Client -> HTTP : Authorized receive-pack
HTTP -> State : Update Git objects and refs
Owner -> API : Browse pushed branch, commit and file
API -> State : Read authorized content
API --> Owner : Expected content
Client -> HTTP : Clone / fetch
HTTP --> Client : Expected repository history
Owner -> API : Revoke PAT and logout
note over Owner,State : Independently test non-owner private denial and session termination
@enduml
